  m_Name: Carta_RoboticaNaColetaDeResiduos
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Rob\xF3tica na Coleta de Res\xEDduos"
  _titleEn: Robotics in Waste Collection
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Rob\xF4s com vis\xE3o computacional separam recicl\xE1veis nas esteiras
    de triagem mais r\xE1pido e com menos erros."
  _summaryEn: Robots with computer vision sort recyclables on sorting lines faster
    and with fewer errors.
  _realWorld: "Usinas de triagem na Europa e nos Estados Unidos j\xE1 usam rob\xF4s
    com intelig\xEAncia artificial para separar pl\xE1stico, papel e metal."
  _realWorldEn: Sorting plants in Europe and the United States already use AI-powered
    robots to separate plastic, paper and metal.
  _tradeOffs: "A automa\xE7\xE3o reduz postos de trabalho de triagem, e no Brasil
    boa parte da reciclagem depende de catadores."
  _tradeOffsEn: Automation cuts sorting jobs, and in Brazil much of recycling depends
    on waste pickers.
  _sources:
  - Label: Wilts et al. (2021), Resources
    Url: https://doi.org/10.3390/resources10040028
